  "classification_method": "month regime, checked in this exact priority order so a month gets exactly one label: 'high_volatility' if stdev(daily % returns within the month) >= 1.5 pct pts; elif monthly_return_pct >= 5.0: 'rally'; elif monthly_return_pct <= -5.0: 'selloff'; elif -2.0 <= monthly_return_pct <= 2.0 AND stdev < 1.0 pct pts: 'sideways' (genuinely quiet -- small net move AND low daily variance, never just a month that missed the rally/selloff cutoffs); else 'unclassified' -- excluded from both the comparison and holdout pools, never sampled, never silently forced into 'sideways' or any other label.",
